  "goodToKnow": "Die Enzyklopädie is an encyclopaedia. The classic German one was der Brockhaus, published from 1808 in Leipzig; its last print edition appeared in 2005–06 before online sources took over. German Wikipedia, founded in 2001, is one of the largest and is known for strict quality standards. Der Duden is the dictionary, not an encyclopaedia. Stressed on the last syllable. Plural: die Enzyklopädien."
